#: ../../source/docs/plane-configuration-landing-page.rst:12
#: b154437cb2034490abda401d6c8b2f00
msgid ""
"In addition to the configuration discussed in this section, you may also "
"choose to :ref:`Configure Optional Hardware <common-optional-hardware>` "
"including battery monitor, sonar, airspeed sensor, optical flow, OSD, camera"
" gimbal, antenna tracker etc."
