"除本节讨论的配置外，您还可以选择 :ref:`配置可选硬件 <common-optional-"
"hardware>`，包括电池监测器、声呐、空速传感器、光流、OSD、相机云台、天线跟踪器等。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-configuration-landing-page.rst:17
#: 817a05bed8d843ffbef5586b56bb0cc6
msgid ""
":ref:`ARSPD_TYPE<ARSPD_TYPE>`  defaults to MS4525. If you don't have an "
"Airspeed sensor or don't have an MS4525 then you should change it and other "
"airspeed related parameters, appropriately."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ARSPD_TYPE<ARSPD_TYPE>` 默认为 MS4525。如果没有空速传感器或没有 "
"MS4525，则应适当更改此参数及其他空速相关参数。"
